 143:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h **** /** \brief Read data from a fifo and remove them from the buffer.
 144:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  *
 145:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * Only complete elements are returned, if count is not a multiple of
 146:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h ****  * elementSize then the incomplete element is not read/removed from the buffer.
