 156:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h **** 
 157:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/_Lib/DataHandling/Ifx_Fifo.h **** /** \brief Write data into a fifo.
